## Input

```css
@mixin frames {
  @keyframes inner { 0% { @if true { opacity: 0; } } }
  25% { opacity: 0.25; }
  @font-face { @if true { font-family: example; } }
  @page { @top-left { @if true { content: "example"; } } }
  50% { opacity: 0.5; }
  @function --value() { @if true { result: 1; } }
  75% { opacity: 0.75; }
  @if true { 100% { opacity: 1; } }
}
.after { color: red; }

```


